---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Code of Conduct — Lisbon AI 2026"
    description="The Lisbon AI Code of Conduct outlines our commitment to a harassment-free experience for all attendees, speakers, sponsors, and volunteers."
>
    <Header />

    <section class="border-t border-white/10">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-16 px-8 md:px-0">
            <div class="small-headline mb-4">/policy</div>
            <h1 class="text-2xl mb-8">Code of Conduct</h1>

            <p class="text-xl mb-12">
                All attendees, speakers, sponsors, and volunteers at Lisbon AI
                must adhere to this Code of Conduct. Organizers will enforce it
                throughout the event.
            </p>

            <h2 class="small-headline mb-4" aria-label="Quick version">
                <span aria-hidden="true">/quick-version</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-12">
                Lisbon AI is committed to providing a harassment-free experience
                for everyone, regardless of gender, sexual orientation,
                disability, appearance, body size, race, religion, or other
                characteristic. Harassment in any form is not tolerated.
                Participants who violate these rules may be sanctioned or
                expelled without refund, at the discretion of the organizers.
            </p>

            <h2 class="small-headline mb-4" aria-label="Harassment definition">
                <span aria-hidden="true">/harassment-definition</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4">Harassment includes, but is not limited to:</p>
            <ul class="mb-8 space-y-2 list-disc pl-6">
                <li>
                    Offensive verbal comments regarding any of the protected
                    categories above
                </li>
                <li>
                    Sexualized language, imagery, or behavior in public or
                    private event spaces
                </li>
                <li>Deliberate intimidation, stalking, or following</li>
                <li>Harassing photography or recording</li>
                <li>Sustained disruption of sessions or activities</li>
                <li>Inappropriate physical contact</li>
                <li>Unwelcome sexual attention</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-12">
                Participants asked to stop any such behavior must comply
                immediately. Sponsors, booth staff, and volunteers are subject
                to the same standards. Sponsors must not present sexualized
                imagery, activities, or environments.
            </p>

            <h2 class="small-headline mb-4" aria-label="Enforcement">
                <span aria-hidden="true">/enforcement</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-12">
                If a participant violates the policy, organizers may take any
                action deemed necessary, including warnings or expulsion without
                refund. Retaliation against anyone reporting an incident is
                strictly prohibited.
            </p>

            <h2 class="small-headline mb-4" aria-label="Reporting">
                <span aria-hidden="true">/reporting</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4">
                If you experience or witness harassment, or have any related
                concerns, contact conference staff immediately. Staff will be
                clearly identified with “STAFF” apparel.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">You can also reach the organizing team directly:</p>
            <ul class="mb-4 space-y-2 list-disc pl-6">
                <li>
                    General: <a
                        href="mailto:team@lisbonai.xyz"
                        class="underline hover:text-cream">team@lisbonai.xyz</a
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    Sponsors and logistics: <a
                        href="mailto:sponsors@lisbonai.xyz"
                        class="underline hover:text-cream"
                        >sponsors@lisbonai.xyz</a
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    Support: <a
                        href="mailto:team@lisbonai.xyz"
                        class="underline hover:text-cream">team@lisbonai.xyz</a
                    >
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-12">
                Anonymous reports may be submitted via the conference website.
                Staff can assist with contacting venue or local authorities,
                arranging escorts, or ensuring personal safety.
            </p>

            <h2 class="small-headline mb-4" aria-label="Scope">
                <span aria-hidden="true">/scope</span>
            </h2>
            <p>
                This Code applies to all Lisbon AI activities — conference
                sessions, workshops, side events, and all associated online
                spaces. Portuguese law governs all serious matters.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
</Layout>
